  Cell["The coefficient of the result has the atom N\:2401i\:2401X with power \
1: that is N^i_X, and the diagram that is left is the bare strand i.", 
   "Text"], Cell["one = FromCharacterCode[120793]; (* \|01d7d9, as the editor \
sends it *)\nterm49 = <|\"c\" -> <|\"n\" -> 1, \"d\" -> 1, \"at\" -> <||>|>, \
\"sums\" -> {}, \"pairs\" -> <|\"\[Beta]\" -> <|\"W\" -> {\"X\"}, \"t\" -> \
one|>|>,\n   \"ld\" -> LD[{}, {{0, B[\"f\", {}, {\"X\"}]}, {0, \
B[\"p_\[Beta]\", {\"X\"}, {}]}, {0, B[\"q_\[Beta]\", {}, \
{\"X\"}]}}]|>;\nsimplifyTermTrace[term49, \"Simples\" -> {\"i\"}] // Column", 
